"merchantToken signature does not match, instead of being marked Failed. Only"
" enable this after you have manually confirmed the notification is genuinely"
" from Nicepay (e.g. it fails re-verification only because "
"nicepay.merchant_key was rotated after this notification was originally "
"received) -- bypassing this check accepts an unauthenticated payload as-is, "
"so use with caution."
msgstr ""
